       <section class="faq" id="faqsection">
  <div class="container-fluid">
    <div class="container-fluid--md content">

      <!-- 1 -->
      <div class="faq__item">
        <div class="faq__head">{lang_What is BGORIUM?}</div>
        <div class="faq__desc">
          <p>{lang_BGORIUM LLC is an Azerbaijan-based technology company combining blockchain, fintech, trading, and environmental industries. Its mission is to convert natural resources into digital value to create economic stability and ecological balance.}</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 2 -->
      <div class="faq__item">
        <div class="faq__head">{lang_What is the BLACK GOLD project?}</div>
        <div class="faq__desc" style="display: none">
          <p>{lang_BLACK GOLD is the core blockchain project developed by BGORIUM. It uses the BGC token for digital operations in energy, trading, fintech, and ecological sectors.}</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 3 -->
      <div class="faq__item">
        <div class="faq__head">{lang_What is the BGC token used for?}</div>
        <div class="faq__desc">
          <p>{lang_The BGC token is the main asset of the BGORIUM ecosystem. It is used for staking, payments, trading, and environmental reward systems.}</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 4 -->
      <div class="faq__item">
        <div class="faq__head">{lang_In which countries will BGORIUM operate?}</div>
        <div class="faq__desc">
          <p>{lang_BGORIUM aims to establish eco-fintech partnerships in 128 countries by 2028. The platform will be internationally recognized and support multiple languages.}</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 5 -->
      <div class="faq__item">
        <div class="faq__head">{lang_What is the “Black Gold Card”?}</div>
        <div class="faq__desc">
          <p>The Black Gold Card is BGORIUM’s fintech payment product. It enables payments using BGC tokens and other digital assets. Three card types will be available: Classic, World, and Premium.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 6 -->
      <div class="faq__item">
        <div class="faq__head">{lang_What payments can be made with the cards?}</div>
        <div class="faq__desc">
          <p>{lang_Users will be able to make payments both online and in physical stores. By 2030, the card system will be integrated with international fintech networks.}</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 7 -->
      <div class="faq__item">
        <div class="faq__head">{lang_Which banks will support the cards?}</div>
        <div class="faq__desc">
          <p>{lang_BGORIUM is currently negotiating with ABB, Bank Respublika, Kapital Bank, and international partners. Full card support is planned for 2030 under the BGORIUM Fintech System.}</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 8 -->
      <div class="faq__item">
        <div class="faq__head">{lang_What is staking?}</div>
        <div class="faq__desc">
          <p>{lang_Staking means locking BGC tokens for a set period to earn rewards. It increases user income while supporting the stability of the network.}</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 9 -->
      <div class="faq__item">
        <div class="faq__head">{lang_What are the staking percentages?}</div>
        <div class="faq__desc">
          <p>{lang_In the initial phase, staking rewards will range between 2% and 6%, depending on the chosen package. VIP and Premium users also receive additional Green Bonus rewards}.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 10 -->
      <div class="faq__item">
        <div class="faq__head">{lang_What are the staking durations?}</div>
        <div class="faq__desc">
          <p>{lang_Users can choose from 6-month, 12-month, and 18-month staking periods.}</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 11 -->
      <div class="faq__item">
        <div class="faq__head">{lang_How are staking rewards paid out?}</div>
        <div class="faq__desc">
          <p>{lang_Rewards are automatically transferred every month to the user’s BGC wallet. All operations are executed transparently through smart contracts.}</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 12 -->
      <div class="faq__item">
        <div class="faq__head">{lang_What is an airdrop, and who can join?}</div>
        <div class="faq__desc">
          <p>{lang_An airdrop is an initial token distribution campaign. Anyone can join by registering and selecting either free or paid packages.}</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 13 -->
      <div class="faq__item">
        <div class="faq__head">{lang_What are the airdrop packages?}</div>
        <div class="faq__desc">
          <p><strong>{lang_Free Package}:</strong> 100 OILCOIN<br>
          <strong>{lang_Standard} (19 USD):</strong> 2% {lang_staking reward}<br>
          <strong>{lang_VIP} (29 USD):</strong> 4% {lang_reward + Green Bonus}<br>
          <strong>{lang_Premium} (39 USD):</strong> 6% {lang_reward + World Card access}</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 14 -->
      <div class="faq__item">
        <div class="faq__head">{lang_How does the referral system work?}</div>
        <div class="faq__desc">
          <p>{lang_Users earn additional OILCOIN tokens by inviting friends. Bonuses are added automatically after successful registration through referral links.}</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 15 -->
      <div class="faq__item">
        <div class="faq__head">{lang_What is the Green Fund?}</div>
        <div class="faq__desc">
          <p>{lang_BGORIUM allocates a portion of every transaction to the Green Fund, which finances tree-planting, renewable energy, and carbon-balance projects.}</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 16 -->
      <div class="faq__item">
        <div class="faq__head">{lang_What is the Green BGC token?}</div>
        <div class="faq__desc">
          <p>{lang_Green BGC is a reward token for users who participate in ecological initiatives. It can be used in the future for marketplace purchases and staking bonuses.}</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 17 -->
      <div class="faq__item">
        <div class="faq__head">{lang_What is BGORIUM’s environmental goal?}</div>
        <div class="faq__desc">
          <p>{lang_The company aims to build a technology model that benefits nature rather than harming it. BGORIUM plans to achieve full carbon neutrality by 2036.}</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 18 -->
      <div class="faq__item">
        <div class="faq__head">{lang_How is BGORIUM protected in terms of security?}</div>
        <div class="faq__desc">
          <p>{lang_The platform uses 2FA, end-to-end encryption, KYC, and meets full GDPR requirements. All data is protected by internationally recognized security standards.}</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 19 -->
      <div class="faq__item">
        <div class="faq__head">{lang_What is KYC and why is it required?}{lang_</div>
        <div class="faq__desc">
          <p>{lang_KYC (Know Your Customer) is an identity verification process. It protects the platform from fraud, money laundering, and unauthorized access.}</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 20 -->
      <div class="faq__item">
        <div class="faq__head">{lang_Under which regulations does BGORIUM operate?}</div>
        <div class="faq__desc">
          <p>{lang_BGORIUM operates under the legislation of the Republic of Azerbaijan and complies with international financial standards. All operations are conducted with full legal transparency.}</p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

